worker-configuration.d.ts

# Delivery-loop scaffolding — the process this repo is built with, not the
# product. Kept out of the tree so the repository is the app and its docs.
#
# NOT ignored, deliberately, because shipped source cites them:
#   - docs/DECISIONS.md — src/ident.ts and src/exchange.ts cite D1/D2 in their
#     header comments, and D1 carries the anchor-collision proof the whole
#     navigation model rests on.
#   - docs/task-specs/ and docs/PROCESS.md — cited by header comments in
#     src/{secrets,exchange,params,headers,cookies,json-index,render-json,
#     render-value}.ts and mcp/*.ts, 20+ references in all. These read as
#     product documentation for the modules rather than as delivery process,
#     and a comment pointing at a file that is not in the repository is worse
#     than the file being here.
#   - test/hygiene.test.ts and test/fixtures/ — real tests, real test data.
#   - CLAUDE.md — the codebase rules, minus the process links.
docs/DELIVERY.md
docs/STATUS.md
docs/templates/
docs/test-plans/
docs/qa-notes/
docs/qa-reports/
docs/qa-checklists/
docs/evidence/
.claude/agents/
scripts/review-preflight.sh
scripts/attack-preflight.sh
